1
00:00:00,094 --> 00:00:02,992
Australia declared war on birds… and LOST!

2
00:00:02,992 --> 00:00:06,578
1932. 20,000 emus were eating the wheat farms.

3
00:00:06,578 --> 00:00:10,768
So the army sent Major Meredith… two machine guns… and 10,000 bullets.

4
00:00:10,768 --> 00:00:14,198
The plan: ambush the flock. But the emus split up… and ran!

5
00:00:14,198 --> 00:00:17,164
So they put a gun on a truck. The emus outran the truck.

6
00:00:17,164 --> 00:00:18,938
Within a week, the army retreated.

7
00:00:18,938 --> 00:00:23,117
The Major said: with soldiers as tough as emus, he could beat any army in the world.

8
00:00:23,117 --> 00:00:25,727
Farmers asked for the army again… the army said no.

9
00:00:25,727 --> 00:00:28,797
Final score: emus 1… Australia 0.
